{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kbqhczyl","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":310,"top":177,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"当时大家都能听到的发言、投票和公开结果。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lczi54z6","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":66,"top":290,"width":240,"height":57},"text":"猜出什么？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#00539B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6d8ze9gr","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":310,"top":290,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"每名玩家是狼人、普通玩家，还是有特殊能力的角色。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7eh07uhc","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":66,"top":403,"width":240,"height":57},"text":"怎么展示？","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#00539B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vit8ba54","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":310,"top":403,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"给出当前判断，并指出依据来自哪句话或哪次投票。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/uhkr254j","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":68,"top":566,"width":985,"height":72},"text":"例如：第二天投票结束后，用前两天的公开记录判断所有玩家。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#C00000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
