{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8fedozm1","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":174,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"能从语言中判断谁更像在隐瞒身份；多是两类判断。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9gnux43m","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":66,"top":281,"width":240,"height":57},"text":"长对话研究","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#00539B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ypcvip4z","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":281,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"证明前后发言和游戏进展有用，但研究的游戏规则不同。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zqlcru5k","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":66,"top":388,"width":240,"height":57},"text":"狼人杀智能体","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#00539B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r25s3qp0","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":388,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"重点让模型学会参与游戏；我们重点判断所有人的身份。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q1wru58f","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":69,"top":548,"width":985,"height":91},"text":"本项目要把公开记录整理、逐轮判断、证据回查和结果评价做成一个系统。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#C00000","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
